{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/AETHUS_Logo.png?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A story-driven sci-fi survival game about mining, base-building, and carving out a future in the ruins of corporate greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ExplorationGifFrame.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About AETHUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Maeve</strong> - an ex-mining engineer from the Astral Research Corporation (<strong>ARC</strong>), a galactic megacorp that profits by draining planets of their resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She\u2019s left the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ARC has not left her, however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Aethus, ARC claims there is nothing worth having. Maeve knows they are wrong. With basic mining equipment, tales from her beloved grandpa and a sarcastic AI drone called <strong>Roland</strong>, she works to build a stable life outside ARC\u2019s corporate control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel a <strong>dystopian capitalist conspiracy</strong> as you delve through the remnants of <strong>a doomed expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/BuildingGifNewWithPanShot.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laser-blast mining in a handcrafted alien world</strong><br>Drill, scavenge, and rebuild as you navigate decaying infrastructure and living terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/SteamPageGif1.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fully voiced narrative about family, grief, and resistance</strong><br>Uncover a dystopian corporate conspiracy, and decide how far you\u2019re willing to go for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/lavacaves.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Companion AI with a mind of its own</strong><br>Meet<strong> </strong>Roland - loyal, sarcastic, and your <i>only</i> company on AETHUS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/RefiningAndCraftingGif.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your outpost, grow your own future</strong><br>From salvage to fungus, rare ores and reclaimed tech, create a home-from-home outpost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/MiningGifNewNew.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Made with care, not crunch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From UK-based indie solo-dev studio, Pawsmonaut Games. No AI content. No microtransactions. Just one person, one vision, one chance to leave your mark on AETHUS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/PawsmonautLogoWhite.png?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pawsmonaut Games is a proud Scottish solo-independent game development studio, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">founded in 2023 to create deep, compelling experiences without micro-transactions, battle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">passes or predatory monetisation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2541530?t=1750670755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2541530?t=1750670755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/d9db3afce325a571b446ec90641e1a3a8d046dc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750670755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/d9db3afce325a571b446ec90641e1a3a8d046dc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750670755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2822250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/AETHUS_Logo.png?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A story-driven sci-fi survival game about mining, base-building, and carving out a future in the ruins of corporate greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ExplorationGifFrame.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About AETHUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <strong>Maeve</strong> - an ex-mining engineer from the Astral Research Corporation (<strong>ARC</strong>), a galactic megacorp that profits by draining planets of their resources.</p>