<i>only</i> company on AETHUS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/RefiningAndCraftingGif.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your outpost, grow your own future</strong><br>From salvage to fungus, rare ores and reclaimed tech, create a home-from-home outpost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/MiningGifNewNew.gif?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Made with care, not crunch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From UK-based indie solo-dev studio, Pawsmonaut Games. No AI content. No microtransactions. Just one person, one vision, one chance to leave your mark on AETHUS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/PawsmonautLogoWhite.png?t=1750670755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pawsmonaut Games is a proud Scottish solo-independent game development studio, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">founded in 2023 to create deep, compelling experiences without micro-transactions, battle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">passes or predatory monetisation.</p>","developers":["Pawsmonaut Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/d999d20a9e47e722be6d2085c741e14d1554f27b/header.jpg?t=1750670755","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157749,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157749/movie480.mp4?t=1750252841","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstati